  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a cave on San Cha Mountain, after the Ten Tyrants complain that Hu Mei Er used them to test the black and white demons, Tyrant Heng Mei slaps the second brother and scolds them that this is not Nan mountain. He tells them heavily injured is fine so long as they are not dead, then warns them not to find problems with Hu Mei Er. He says this demoness seduces men to their death, has a wide network, and is involved with Lin San Chi, has rumors with Li Xian, and even Mo Wu Tian. Narration calls his metal and earth specialty renowned through the land. Be it Lin San Chi, Li Xian, or Mo Wu Tian, they are all rank four Gu Masters. The nine brothers go pale and speechless.",
